WEBVTT

00:14:29.204 --> 00:14:33.260
In fact, their stories show

00:14:33.284 --> 00:14:38.029
that this word is a central feature
of their lives as young people

00:14:38.053 --> 00:14:39.453
in the United States.

00:14:40.627 --> 00:14:42.484
It's in the music they love.

00:14:42.508 --> 00:14:45.019
And in the popular culture they emulate,

00:14:45.043 --> 00:14:47.087
the comedy they watch,

00:14:47.111 --> 00:14:49.500
it's in TV and movies

00:14:49.524 --> 00:14:51.738
and memorialized in museums.

00:14:52.516 --> 00:14:54.485
They hear it in locker rooms,

00:14:54.509 --> 00:14:56.301
on Instagram,

00:14:56.325 --> 00:14:58.349
in the hallways at school,

00:14:58.373 --> 00:15:01.283
in the chat rooms
of the video games they play.